    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banana Cowboy is an adventure platformer set in a fruit-themed universe. You are the Banana Cowboy, the outcasted son of the king of the Banana Planet. However, your tyrannical twin brother has taken control of the fruit worlds with his evil blender, and it is up to you to liberate the universe. Save your scattered people from the Orange Bikers and Blueberry Pirates using your trusty lasso!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/2e206b8e7f72aa5562f4fb49537f80a3.avif?t=1740325106\" width=590 height=330 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swing Your Way Through</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty lasso to swing on different objects ranging from soda cans and bottles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/c380b2ce1cb6d6e41bc5cdddb02b75c8.poster.avif?t=1740325106\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/c380b2ce1cb6d6e41bc5cdddb02b75c8.webm?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/c380b2ce1cb6d6e41bc5cdddb02b75c8.mp4?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/6233b1c7bb3e9850d2e0339a7354208f.poster.avif?t=1740325106\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/6233b1c7bb3e9850d2e0339a7354208f.webm?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/6233b1c7bb3e9850d2e0339a7354208f.mp4?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw Enemies and Bombs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab hold onto objects and throw them to break barriers or fight the bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/895e99c09e1b967d9039081c365897b9.poster.avif?t=1740325106\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/895e99c09e1b967d9039081c365897b9.webm?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/895e99c09e1b967d9039081c365897b9.mp4?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/513f3985984675af7c475eb909fabfef.poster.avif?t=1740325106\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/513f3985984675af7c475eb909fabfef.webm?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/513f3985984675af7c475eb909fabfef.mp4?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Fruit Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will make your way through 5 fruit themed planets, the Prickly Pear Cowboys, the Orange Bikers, the Blueberry Pirates, the Strawberry Mafia, and the Banana Kingdom! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/f0a5ab214097e89284a1e11fc8d97f23.avif?t=1740325106\" width=640 height=123 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banana Cowboy is an adventure platformer set in a fruit-themed universe. You are the Banana Cowboy, the outcasted son of the king of the Banana Planet. However, your tyrannical twin brother has taken control of the fruit worlds with his evil blender, and it is up to you to liberate the universe. Save your scattered people from the Orange Bikers and Blueberry Pirates using your trusty lasso!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/2e206b8e7f72aa5562f4fb49537f80a3.avif?t=1740325106\" width=590 height=330 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swing Your Way Through</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty lasso to swing on different objects ranging from soda cans and bottles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/c380b2ce1cb6d6e41bc5cdddb02b75c8.poster.avif?t=1740325106\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/c380b2ce1cb6d6e41bc5cdddb02b75c8.webm?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/c380b2ce1cb6d6e41bc5cdddb02b75c8.mp4?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/6233b1c7bb3e9850d2e0339a7354208f.poster.avif?t=1740325106\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/6233b1c7bb3e9850d2e0339a7354208f.webm?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/6233b1c7bb3e9850d2e0339a7354208f.mp4?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw Enemies and Bombs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab hold onto objects and throw them to break barriers or fight the bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/895e99c09e1b967d9039081c365897b9.poster.avif?t=1740325106\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/895e99c09e1b967d9039081c365897b9.webm?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/895e99c09e1b967d9039081c365897b9.mp4?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/513f3985984675af7c475eb909fabfef.poster.avif?t=1740325106\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/513f3985984675af7c475eb909fabfef.webm?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/513f3985984675af7c475eb909fabfef.mp4?t=1740325106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Fruit Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will make your way through 5 fruit themed planets, the Prickly Pear Cowboys, the Orange Bikers, the Blueberry Pirates, the Strawberry Mafia, and the Banana Kingdom! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962650/extras/f0a5ab214097e89284a1e11fc8d97f23.avif?t=1740325106\" width=640 height=123 /></span></p>",
